class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: region;"><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="region" placeholder="NY" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div></div></div><div class="deck-table-cell" data-label="Rate (%)" data-field-type="text"><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: rate;"><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="rate" required placeholder="8.875" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div></div></div><div class="deck-table-cell" data-label="Label" data-field-type="text"><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: label;"><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="label" placeholder="Sales tax" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div></div></div><div class="deck-table-actions"><button type="button" class="button btn trash" title="Delete row"></button></div></div></template><button type="button" title="Add Item" class="button btn cms-add"></button></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">One row for each place you charge tax. The most specific row wins: a region's rate over its country's, a country's over a row with no country. When the payment provider works out the tax, these rates are for orders paid with a provider that cannot, such as PayPal: leave the table empty and those orders carry no tax.</p></div><div class="form-field radio-field  choice-field" data-type="radio" style="--grid-area: shippingMode;"><fieldset><legend>Shipping</legend><div class="radio"><input id="field-UID-1" name="shippingMode" type="radio" value="none" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID-1" class="radio-label">No shipping</label></div><div class="radio"><input id="field-UID-2" name="shippingMode" type="radio" value="flat" aria-describedby="help-UID"/><label for="field-UID-2" class="radio-label">Flat rate</label></div><div class="radio"><input id="field-UID-3" name="shippingMode" type="radio" value="zones" aria-describedby="help-UID"/><label for="field-UID-3" class="radio-label">By zone</label></div></fieldset><p class="help" id="help-UID"><strong>No shipping</strong> charges none. <strong>Flat rate</strong> charges one amount for every order. <strong>By zone</strong> charges by where the order ships.</p></div><div class="form-field price-field icon-dollar field-hidden" data-type="price" style="--grid-area: shippingFlatRate; display: none;" data-settings="{&quot;visibility&quot;:{&quot;watch&quot;:&quot;shippingMode&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;flat&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;==&quot;},&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;locale&quot;:&quot;en_US&quot;,&quot;decimals&quot;:2}"><label for="field-UID">Flat Rate</label><div class="form-group"><span class="totalform-currency-symbol">$</span><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="shippingFlatRate" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="0" autocomplete="nofill" inputmode="decimal"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The shipping charge for every order, in the store's currency.</p></div><div class="form-field price-field icon-dollar field-hidden" data-type="price" style="--grid-area: shippingFreeOver; display: none;" data-settings="{&quot;visibility&quot;:{&quot;watch&quot;:&quot;shippingMode&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;flat&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;==&quot;},&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;locale&quot;:&quot;en_US&quot;,&quot;decimals&quot;:2}"><label for="field-UID">Free Shipping Over</label><div class="form-group"><span class="totalform-currency-symbol">$</span><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="shippingFreeOver" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="0" autocomplete="nofill" inputmode="decimal"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Orders at or over this amount ship free. Leave empty for never.</p></div><div class="form-field deck-field  field-hidden" data-type="deck" style="--grid-area: shippingZones; display: none;" data-settings="{&quot;visibility&quot;:{&quot;watch&quot;:&quot;shippingMode&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;zones&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;==&quot;},&quot;deckItemLabel&quot;:&quot;${label}&quot;,&quot;schemaref&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.totalcms.co\/schemas\/commerce-shipping-zone.json&quot;}"><label for="field-UID">Shipping Zones</label><div class="form-group"><input id="field-UID" type="text" name="shippingZones" value="shippingZones" data-proxy="true"/><template class="deck-template"><div class="deck-item deck-item-" data-deck-label-pattern="${label}"><button type="button" class="button btn deck-item-label sort-handle"></button><button type="button" class="button btn edit" title="Edit  item"></button><button type="button" class="button btn duplicate" title="Duplicate  item"></button><button type="button" class="button btn trash" title="Delete  item"></button><dialog class="cms-modal small"><section class="scroller"><style>
#formgrid-ID-container {
	container-type: inline-size;
}
#formgrid-ID {
	grid-template-areas:
		'label'
		'countries'
		'regions'
		'rate'
		'freeOver'
		'id';
	grid-template-columns: 1fr;
}
@container (min-width: 500px) {
	#formgrid-ID {
		grid-template-areas:
			'label label'
			'countries regions'
			'rate freeOver'
			'id id';
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
	}
}
