ands</option><option value="VI">U.S. Virgin Islands</option><option value="UG">Uganda</option><option value="UA">Ukraine</option><option value="AE">United Arab Emirates</option><option value="GB">United Kingdom</option><option value="US">United States</option><option value="UY">Uruguay</option><option value="UZ">Uzbekistan</option><option value="VU">Vanuatu</option><option value="VA">Vatican City</option><option value="VE">Venezuela</option><option value="VN">Vietnam</option><option value="WF">Wallis &amp; Futuna</option><option value="EH">Western Sahara</option><option value="YE">Yemen</option><option value="ZM">Zambia</option><option value="ZW">Zimbabwe</option><option value="AX">Åland Islands</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The countries in this zone. Leave empty for a zone that covers every country, such as a last zone for the rest of the world.</p></div><div class="form-field list-field " data-type="list" style="--grid-area: regions;"><label for="field-UID">Regions</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="regions" multiple size="1" aria-describedby="help-UID"></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Optional. States or provinces, to limit the zone to part of its countries, such as CA and OR. Leave empty for the whole of each country.</p></div><div class="form-field price-field icon-dollar" data-type="price" style="--grid-area: rate;" data-settings="{&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;locale&quot;:&quot;en_US&quot;,&quot;decimals&quot;:2}"><label for="field-UID">Rate</label><div class="form-group"><span class="totalform-currency-symbol">$</span><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="rate" required aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill" inputmode="decimal"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The shipping charge in the store's currency, such as <code>12.00</code>.</p></div><div class="form-field price-field icon-dollar" data-type="price" style="--grid-area: freeOver;" data-settings="{&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;locale&quot;:&quot;en_US&quot;,&quot;decimals&quot;:2}"><label for="field-UID">Free Over</label><div class="form-group"><span class="totalform-currency-symbol">$</span><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="freeOver" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill" inputmode="decimal"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Orders at or over this amount ship free in this zone. Leave empty for never.</p></div></div></div></section><section><button type="button" class="button btn close">Close</button></section></dialog></div></template><button type="button" title="Add Item" class="button btn cms-add"></button></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">One zone for each group of places with one rate. An order ships at the rate of the first zone that covers its address, so list the most exact first. An address no zone covers cannot be checked out.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: receiptMailer;" data-settings="{&quot;relationalOptions&quot;:{&quot;collection&quot;:&quot;mailer&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;name&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;id&quot;}}"><label for="field-UID">Receipt Email</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="receiptMailer" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled>commerce-receipt</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The mailer template sent when an order is paid, and for each renewal of a subscription.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: paymentFailedMailer;" data-settings="{&quot;relationalOptions&quot;:{&quot;collection&quot;:&quot;mailer&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;name&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;id&quot;}}"><label for="field-UID">Failed Payment Email</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="paymentFailedMailer" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled>commerce-payment-failed</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The mailer template sent once when a subscription's renewal payment fails.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: returnPage;" data-settings="{&quot;relationalOptions&quot;:{&quot;collection&quot;:&quot;builder-pages&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;title&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;id&quot;}}"><label for="field-UID">Order Page</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="returnPage" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled selected>The built-in page</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The Site Builder page that shows an order after payment. Leave empty to use the built-in page.</p></div><div class="form-field select-field  field-hidden" data-type="select" style="--grid-area: payPage; display: none;" data-settings="{&quot;relationalOptions&quot;:{&quot;collection&quot;:&quot;builder-pages&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;title&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;id&quot;},&quot;visibility&quot;:{&quot;watch&quot;:&quot;checkoutMode&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;embedded&quot;,&quot;operator&quot;:&quot;==&quot;}}"><label for="field-UID">Payment Page</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="payPage" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value class="placeholder" disabled selected>The built-in page</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The Site Builder page that holds the payment form when checkout is on this site. Leave empty to use the built-in page.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: downloadTtlHours;"><label for="field-UID">Download Link Lifetime (hours)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="downloadTtlHours" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="72" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="72" min="1" max="8760" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">How long a link to a purchased file works after the order is paid.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: downloadMaxCount;"><label for="field-UID">Downloads per Purchase</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="downloadMaxCount" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="5" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="5" min="1" max="1000" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">How many times one purchased file can be downloaded.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: lowStockAt;"><label for="field-UID">Low Stock At</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="lowStockAt" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="5" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="5" min="0" max="100000" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">A product that counts its stock is running low when this many or fewer are left. The dashboard lists it, and the stock.low event fires once as its count comes down to this number. Set 0 for no warning before a product sells out.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: pendingOrderTtlHours;"><label for="field-UID">Abandoned Checkout Lifetime (hours)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="pendingOrderTtlHours" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="24" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="24" min="1" max="720" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">An order that was started and never paid is cancelled after this long.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: cartMaxLines;"><label for="field-UID">Most Lines in a Cart</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="cartMaxLines" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="100" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="100" min="1" max="1000" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The most different items one cart can hold.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: cartMaxQty;"><label for="field-UID">Most of One Item</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="cartMaxQty" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="99" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="99" min="1" max="100000" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The highest quantity of one item in a cart.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: customPriceMax;"><label for="field-UID">Highest Price a Buyer Can Enter</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="customPriceMax" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="10000" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="10000" min="1" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Used by products that let buyers choose the price. Catches a slip of the finger.</p></div><div class="form-field list-field " data-type="list" style="--grid-area: checkoutAttributes;"><label for="field-UID">Checkout Attributes</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="checkoutAttributes" multiple size="1" aria-describedby="help-UID"></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Extra values checkout may take from the buyer, by name, such as <code>giftNote</code>. Anything not named here is dropped.</p></div><div class="form-field multiselect-field " data-type="multiselect" style="--grid-area: grantableGroups;" data-settings="{&quot;accessGroupOptions&quot;:true}"><label for="field-UID">Groups a Product May Grant</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="grantableGroups" multiple aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="admin">admin</option><option value="blogger">blogger</option><option value="default">default</option><option value="editor">editor</option><option value="limited-blogger">limited-blogger</option><option value="viewer">viewer</option><option value="schema-editor">schema-editor</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">A product can give its buyer an access group: a membership. Only the groups chosen here can be given, and the admin group never can. Leave empty and no product grants anything.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form></div>